# DXTN — System Architecture

## Core Principle
DXTN is one interconnected editing ecosystem, not a collection of disconnected tools.

## Shared Engines
- Timeline and Composition Engine
- Keyframe and Animation Engine
- Effects and Preset Engine
- Media Processing Engine
- AI Integration Layer
- Project and Asset Management
- Motion Tracking Engine
- Rendering and Export Engine
- Extension and Security Manager
- Storage, Autosave and Recovery

## Main Modules
- Editing Studio
- Animation Studio
- Speed Lab
- Colour Lab
- Audio Studio
- AI Studio
- Motion & Layer Lab
- Masking & Compositing
- Cover Editor
- Creative Library
- Projects
- Profile
- Extensions
- 3D Studio
- Creator Community

## Engineering Rule
Every module must integrate with the shared project, timeline and media systems.

No decorative buttons or fake functionality.
